Procedure K.2.

1. Corrupt the model by \eta: replace T, Z with \hat{T}, \hat{Z} such that the TV distance is \eta.
2. Run Procedure K.1 under the corrupted model.
3. Estimate \hat{P}_{\mathcal{M}^*}(\bigcup F_t) and compare to \varepsilon + T\eta.

Remark K.2. This validates Corollary B.1 without physical tests or code training.

